.TH FATHOM_DOCTOR 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-doctor \- Describe this build, its environment and its index, with a remedy per finding
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom doctor\fR [\fB\-\-privacy\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-deep\fR] [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Describe this build, its environment and its index, with a remedy per finding
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-privacy\fR
Print the network\-feature and consent table
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the same report as JSON, for a machine
.TP
\fB\-\-deep\fR
Run the whole\-database `integrity_check` rather than `quick_check` (ADR\-004 §9.6)
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Exit with the code of the worst finding instead of 0 — what CI and a pre\-flight check want
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to report on
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
